From ruth at stats.ox.ac.uk  Tue Mar  8 23:35:55 2011
From: ruth at stats.ox.ac.uk (Ruth M. Ripley)
Date: Tue, 8 Mar 2011 22:35:55 +0000 (GMT Standard Time)
Subject: [Rsiena-help] Accessing the simulated networks
In-Reply-To: <4D768795.6070200@cornell.edu>
References: <4D768795.6070200@cornell.edu>
Message-ID: <Pine.WNT.4.64.1103082231530.3076@reeve>

Dear Brian,

You need to ask for the simulations to be returned. Use returnDeps=TRUE in 
the call to siena07.

By the way, you can turn off estimation by using nsub=0 in the call to 
sienaModelCreate. If you do this, you do not need to fix the parameters.

Regards,

Ruth


